  "notes": "Public system of the Republic of Cyprus: six-year primary (entry at age 6 by 1 September), three-year Gymnasium, three-year Unified Lyceum; Technical Schools are a parallel upper-secondary path with the same three years. The Ministry's guide (2009) calls the years 'Gymnasium Grade 1' and 'Lyceum Form A'. Schools in the areas not under the effective control of the Republic follow a separate Turkish-language system, not covered here."
